					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Hao"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 718090201,
					"content": "All is well, all is well...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718090202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hao"
				},
				{
					"id": 718090202,
					"content": "What's well?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718090203
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 718090203,
					"content": "Oh, it's you, Traveler. So, there was a big incident in the city earlier, right?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718090204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hao"
				},
				{
					"id": 718090204,
					"content": "Well, it's well that nothing untoward happened afterward... And more importantly, it's well that all the food stalls in the city are still open.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718090205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hao"
				},
				{
					"id": 718090205,
					"content": "I mean, what would become of all those delicacies I enjoyed otherwise...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718090206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hao"
				},
				{
					"id": 718090206,
					"content": "Ah, so it's about eating, then...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718090207
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 718090207,
					"content": "Hey, don't you look down on it. The quickest way to know if a place is good or not is to see how its cuisine tastes.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718090208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Hao"
				},
				{
					"id": 718090208,
					"content": "Ah, just talking about this is making me hungry again. Maybe I should go get a little something...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Hao"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7180903,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7180906
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"7180906",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 7180906,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Fan Er'ye"
				],
				"points": []
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 718090301,
					"content": "The more I hear of this opera, the less I understand it...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718090302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fan Er'ye"
				},
				{
					"id": 718090302,
					"content": "Is something wrong?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718090303
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 718090303,
					"content": "Why, hello there, Traveler. Well, here's the problem: Heyu Tea House has released a few new operas lately.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718090304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fan Er'ye"
				},
				{
					"id": 718090304,
					"content": "But they're— Well, they're most lively, that's for sure. But I do not quite comprehend them, or how the young people seem to enjoy it so very much.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718090305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fan Er'ye"
				},
				{
					"id": 718090305,
					"content": "And how do you feel about that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718090306
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 718090306,
					"content": "That's a good question. Personally, I don't mind hearing some old classics. They're what I'm used to, after all.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718090307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fan Er'ye"
				},
				{
					"id": 718090307,
					"content": "But at the same time, Liyue Harbor is undergoing so many changes. A few new operas seem to fit the reigning mood just fine, too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						718090308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Fan Er'ye"
				},
				{
					"id": 718090308,
					"content": "*sigh* Still, these changes feel all too swift. The old operas haven't played in a while. I wonder what Rex Lapis would— No, let us not speak of that...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Fan Er'ye"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 7180904,
			"completionStepIds": [
				7180909
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
